      "original": "-- Copyright (c) 2019 Digital Asset (Switzerland) GmbH and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.\n-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n\nmodule Iou where\n\ntemplate Iou\n  with\n    issuer : Party\n    owner : Party\n    locker : Party\n    amount : Decimal\n    currency : Text\n  where\n    signatory issuer\n\n    controller owner can\n      Transfer : ContractId Iou\n        with newOwner : Party\n        do\n          assert $ owner == locker\n          create this with owner = newOwner; locker = newOwner\n      Lock : ContractId Iou\n        with newLocker : Party\n        do\n          assert $ owner == locker\n          create this with locker = newLocker\n\n    controller locker can\n      Unlock : ContractId Iou\n        do\n          assert $ owner /= locker\n          create this with locker = owner\n",
